  "description": "Use of 320 Station Road, Harrow, HA1 2DX as an Adult Gaming Centre \n(Sui Generis) ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposal for a gaming centre in the newly redeveloped building on\r\nthis site, owing to the nature of the proposed use, along with the 24-hour\r\nopening times, would be detrimental to the residential amenities of the\r\nneighbouring properties, resulting in noise and general disturbance, contrary\r\nto policies D3 and D1 of the London Plan (2021), and DM1 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies (2013) and GR1 of the Draft Local Plan\r\n(2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
